 * \`\`\`
 *
 * On failure: returns \`c.json({ error: <reason> }, status)\` directly
 * (Hono short-circuits when middleware returns a Response). On
 * success: stashes \`c.set("idempotency", { key, deduped })\` and
 * continues with \`await next()\`.
